<title>POLAND: Sanok Q2 net falls to PLN 5.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Sanok Q2 net falls to PLN 5.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanok preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 7.65 vs	6.03</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   8.50 vs	5.75</p>
<p>    net profit				 5.41 vs	5.78</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Stomil Sanok SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 42.40 vs     37.09</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  29.75 vs     26.84</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs	0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.08 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.02 vs	0.27</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.18 vs	0.55</p>
<p>    investment				 4.04 vs	2.45</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			13.99 vs	8.74</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  15.50 vs	8.40</p>
<p>    net profit				10.45 vs	8.40</p>
<p>    net sales				 81.01 vs     69.76</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  56.98 vs     51.61</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs	0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				 5.05 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.74 vs	0.65</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.24 vs	1.01</p>
<p>    investment				 7.97 vs	7.22</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
